meta {
  name: React
  type: http
  seq: 17
}

put {
  url: {{api}}/entries/{{partnerEntryId}}/reaction
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "type": "HEART"
  }
}

docs {
  Leaves a reaction on your partner's entry: 204, and 204 again for the same one. A second type replaces the first; there is one reaction per entry. The type is HEART, THANK_YOU, SMILE, MOVED or ME_TOO, exactly as written here; anything else is 422, and a body with any other key is 400.

  Unlike a favourite, your partner IS shown it: the entry carries it as "reaction" for both of you, on Today, Days and Day. Nothing says when it was left.

  Run Days first, which keeps your partner's entry of the newest day as partnerEntryId. Only your partner's revealed entry takes one. Your own is 409 REACTION_ON_OWN_ENTRY; one that has been deleted or withdrawn is 409 ENTRY_IMMUTABLE; once the bond has ended it is 409 BOND_ARCHIVED; anything you were never shown is 404.
}
